{
  "meta": {
    "site": "https://github.com/zengfr/n8n-workflow-all-templates",
    "tokenfree": "https://tokenyep.com/",
    "name": "Reply to missed calls with Twilio and log leads in Google Sheets",
    "wechat": "youandme10086",
    "id": 18582,
    "update_time": "2026-09-27"
  },
  "name": "Send Twilio SMS replies to missed calls and log leads in Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ed357d7e-8e99-4d62-82ce-fd90c21a53da",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -672,
        -256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## Send Twilio SMS replies to missed calls and log leads in Google Sheets\n\n### How it works\n\n1. A webhook receives the call-status event from your phone provider the moment a call ends.\n2. An IF node passes only calls whose status is not \"completed\", so answered calls are ignored.\n3. A Set node assembles the caller number, your number and the SMS wording.\n4. Twilio texts the caller back within seconds, and the lead is appended to a Google Sheet.\n5. A short summary email tells the owner who rang and that they have already been replied to.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Point your phone provider's missed-call webhook at this workflow's Production URL (in Twilio: Phone Numbers -> your number -> Call Status Changes).\n- [ ] Add Twilio credentials to \"Send SMS reply via Twilio\" and confirm the from field resolves to your own number.\n- [ ] Connect Google Sheets credentials and pick the leads spreadsheet and tab on \"Append lead row to Google Sheets\".\n- [ ] Add SMTP credentials and replace owner@example.com in \"Email missed call alert to owner\".\n\n### Customization\n\nRewrite the SMS wording in \"Build SMS reply text\" so it sounds like you. Swap Google Sheets for Airtable or your CRM, add columns to the log, or remove the owner email if the text alone is enough.\n---\n\nFree tool: [work out what missed calls cost you](https://tools.digitaldotsent.com/missed-call-revenue-calculator.html) - by Digital Dots"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ed25acc5-c10e-49bf-a43e-410a39a03177",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -112,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 448,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Catch the missed call\n\nThe webhook receives the provider's call-status event and the IF node lets only genuinely unanswered calls through."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "bcfb26e5-6bc7-4858-a990-184697cfe074",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        416,
        -256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 448,
        "height": 288,
        "content": "## Build and send the text-back\n\nSets the caller number, your number and the message, then Twilio sends the SMS within seconds."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "9716187c-8098-4c13-9e9d-f05672ed2875",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        928,
        -256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 448,
        "height": 288,
        "content": "## Log the lead and notify\n\nAppends the caller to your leads sheet and emails the owner a short summary of what happened."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c33917dd-885a-4bc6-8186-54316b2d0969",
      "name": "Receive call status from phone provider",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "position": [
        -60,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "missed-call",
        "options": {},
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "onReceived"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "942517b9-cdf2-4918-9fdb-14752d16fb2a",
      "name": "Filter out answered calls",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        200,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c67057a5-7990-4241-821a-7721da3752ef",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.CallStatus || $json.CallStatus }}",
              "rightValue": "completed"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "818b424c-dd3e-4d3e-bb41-0b8a745e15cb",
      "name": "Build SMS reply text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        460,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "d67d54ab-2f74-46f9-aa99-9e1c7ae2db2f",
              "name": "caller",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.From || $json.From }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3d9f33e-587a-44ac-b102-40b704ba4a5e",
              "name": "your_number",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.To || $json.To }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "1dd7b037-c57b-4041-8a8a-99a506d8276d",
              "name": "message",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Hi, sorry we missed your call — we're on a job right now. Reply here with what you need and roughly where you are, and we'll get straight back to you."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "de0fa93c-9273-48d5-b474-4630b4e332f0",
      "name": "Send SMS reply via Twilio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.twilio",
      "position": [
        720,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "to": "={{ $json.caller }}",
        "from": "={{ $json.your_number }}",
        "message": "={{ $json.message }}",
        "options": {},
        "resource": "sms",
        "operation": "send"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "569445f3-ddc6-459c-ac12-5a1eef76db96",
      "name": "Append lead row to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        980,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "columns": {
          "value": {
            "Time": "={{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm') }}",
            "Caller": "={{ $json.caller }}",
            "Source": "Missed call",
            "Status": "Texted back — awaiting reply"
          },
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "matchingColumns": []
        },
        "options": {},
        "operation": "append",
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "570d0119-6054-4ad1-9916-5c41b910fffe",
      "name": "Email missed call alert to owner",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "position": [
        1240,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=A call from {{ $json.caller }} was missed at {{ $now.format('HH:mm') }}.\n\nWe've already texted them asking what they need, and it's logged in the leads sheet.\n\nIf they reply, pick it up from your phone.",
        "sendTo": "user@example.com",
        "options": {},
        "subject": "=Missed call from {{ $json.caller }} — auto-replied",
        "emailFormat": "text"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
